@api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@idempotencyKey = 90971c8e-e3c1-4c63-b54b-2343ad228002

### Consulta correcta: 200 OK
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Ruta de API inexistente: 404 Problem Details
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/no-existe
Accept: application/json

### Auditoria sin rol Operations: 403 Problem Details
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/audit
Accept: application/json

### Transferencia invalida: 400 Problem Details con campos
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-001",
  "destinationType": "OWN",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-002",
  "amount": 3000.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "no-es-guid"
}

### Transferencia valida: primera solicitud 202 Accepted; repite la misma clave para verificar 200 duplicada
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-001",
  "destinationType": "OWN",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-002",
  "amount": 10.00,
  "description": "Aporte mensual",
  "idempotencyKey": "{{idempotencyKey}}"
}

### Comprueba la referencia de depuracion en X-Request-Id y traceId del JSON
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers
Accept: application/json
